  "notes": "Tailwind slate look: a slate-100 page with a white rounded sidebar card and a 720px chat column. The brand character comes from indigo→purple→pink gradients on the waveform logo, the 'SpeechGPT' wordmark, the circular avatars (purple for user, green-yellow for assistant), the Send button (violet) and the Record button (red→orange). Conversations are marked by coloured dots, and starred ones are pinned above a divider. Each message shows hover actions (speak, delete, copy) in small square slate buttons. The capture shows the settings modal open over a grey backdrop. The modal scrolls internally and has vertical tabs. The OpenAI key and host are editable, which shows a bring-your-own-key client. A kebab menu (Setting / Feedback / About) is the entry point to settings. The thread itself has no streaming or stop control."
